WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.749
This is the Daily Karma. Today’s practice is ma: the space between. Find a supported position. Let your eyes close, or rest gently on the painting.

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.731
Notice the weight of your body being held. Let the tongue rest and the shoulders fall. Allow this moment to ask nothing from you.

3
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:07.427
Feel the quiet rhythm of breathing. When the mind moves ahead, come back to one simple inhale and one unhurried exhale.

4
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:34.077
Ma is the interval. Not empty space, but the space that gives everything else its shape. A room is useful because of the part with nothing in it.

5
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:01.263
Ink on paper with wide margins left bare. The painter did not run out of paper. The emptiness is where the mountain gets to be far away.

6
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:30.263
Notice what your body is doing with these words. Soften around the eyes, the hands, and the belly. Keep only the effort needed to stay present.

7
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:57.567
Return to the pause at the end of your out-breath. Do not stretch it or hurry it. Be in the interval rather than racing toward the next thing.

8
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:25.520
Now rest in a short silence. Sounds, sensations, and thoughts may come and go. Let awareness remain spacious around them.

9
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:04.567
Still here. Still breathing. Nothing special needs to happen. This quiet awareness is already a useful way of meeting your life.

10
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:27.681
Leave one gap on purpose today. Five minutes between two meetings. A walk taken slowly. Silence after a question instead of a quick answer.

11
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:53.124
Take one fuller breath. Feel the space beyond your body and let your eyes open in their own time. Thank you for practicing with Karma.
